---
manual: styles.style_method
lines: [1037, 1038]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400 do
  @box = stack width: 100 do
    para "inside"
  end
end
----------- test code
box = stack("@box")
assert_equal 100, box.style[:width], "the slot starts at the width it was created with"

box.style(width: 250)

assert_equal 250, box.style[:width], "style(hash) works on a slot, not only on elements"
assert_equal 250, box.width, "the slot's width follows the new style"
